{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a text adventure game that focuses on the growth love story between an agent and an artist, pursuing dreams, love and self-identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, the player will play the role of a poor, unknown novice agent. After taking over the agency left by his father for some reason, he has to work hard everywhere and look for potential newcomers to sign to ensure that the agency does not go bankrupt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will encounter and communicate with more than one heroine and supporting actress, and develop a touching and profound story. But the ending of the story is not absolute, what will be the final outcome? It's up to the players to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are about to release the DEMO trial version of this game, which is a prequel that briefly describes what happened before the main story of the game, telling the mysterious past of the male protagonist played by the player, and allowing players to take a peek at some of the gameplay and style of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you injoy it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672880?t=1747358868","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672880/d63608afb37df238bd98b495a3711049db9e8ca8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747358868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672880/f7ee2ea138580d27add6bae0ea55c87e4f7aec2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747358868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672880/f7ee2ea138580d27add6bae0ea55c87e4f7aec2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747358868","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"note